{"c":[{"id":"08c734f3ed243af8d0a8ebaf38bcb113eaee72ffd2f3eaa7afd7b27a88c47b47","sum":"Root wake labels a non-empty git-root document; emergency delete is surgery.py (zipper out, unlink one note, heal_view), not a subcommand","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260820T233118Z-a3b7a5135628a4f0","text":"Root wake prints == Project-root Memories == when the git-root document is non-empty, catalog or not. Pull wakes stay unlabeled.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260821T155541Z-842d10e98fbc74de","text":"Emergency delete is repo-root surgery.py, not a summem subcommand: zipper break-out of containing naps, unlink that one note, heal_view; it does not rewrite git history or write nap captions.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"8c9885aa12cc2275c410460b0a6571edd29d32f283668f4411bf3511de6e5067","sum":"Successful note prints Saved. then maybe a fold request; the nap is extra work on already-stored memory - do not retry the same note (PR #29 closed #27)","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260821T160046Z-f394b9340bcc2577","text":"Successful summem note prints Saved. then maybe a fold request. A nap after note is extra work on already-stored memory; do not retry the same note.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260821T160735Z-ea1c2c79f1a46533","text":"Draft PR #29 feat/note-ack closes #27: successful note prints Saved. then maybe a fold request; do not retry the same note.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
